  message: "Re-confirmed 2026-10-16 (docstring audit verifier): repro with a.php (<?hh header) + b.hack -> analyze_hack emits only b.hack's symbol. git log -S shows the production caller find_hack_files(self.repo_root) was removed in cfd3132756 (Phase 3 extended1 TreeSitterAnalyzer migration), so this is a regression, not never-landed. Docstring left stating the intent."  # 03af
